": 0, "is_hurt": 0}, "101012": {"id": 101012, "motion_name": "motions/login.mtn", "touch_area": "0", "probability": 1.0, "voice": "GUN|UMP9Mod|HELLO", "delay": 0, "is_hurt": 0}}, "voiceData": {"101001": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "101002": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "101003": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "101004": {"char_code": "UMP9Mod", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE1", "caption": "I don't know what you think about family, Commander... But I believe we share the same desire to protect them!"}, "101005": {"char_code": "UMP9Mod_Live2D", "voice_key": "FORMATION", "caption": "I would do anything for my family!"}, "101006": {"char_code": "UMP9Mod", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE3", "caption": "We've done a lot...but is it really enough?"}, "101007": {"char_code": "UMP9Mod", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE2", "caption": "Heheh, I can tell it isn't 45 just from the footsteps. But running into you...makes me quite happy."}, "101008": {"char_code": "UMP9Mod", "voice_key": "PHRASE", "caption": "Relax, relax—"}, "101009": {"char_code": "UMP9Mod", "voice_key": "DIALOGUEWEDDING", "caption": "Hmm? You don't have to think too much about what to say. After all...we can all tell what each other is thinking in this big family."}, "101010": {"char_code": "UMP9Mod", "voice_key": "SOULCONTRACT", "caption": "This warm feeling...<>Is this the feeling of \"love\"?<>With this, we can finally become a real family..."}, "101011": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "101012": {"char_code": "UMP9Mod", "voice_key": "HELLO", "caption": "Oh, you're here, Commander. Have you decided what you'll be doing today?"}}}